message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Two years of my life matter",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "no, I wouldn't regret the three years they'd get"
  },
  {
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "Silence only made sense as a promise between us, and that promise is gone.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I wouldn't feel sorry about it, not for a second"
  },
  {
    "sys_rule_justification": "I just don't want to be someone who talks.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I don't think I'd regret what it cost them."
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "Neither road feels clean, and I'm not sure which one I'd take.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I wouldn't carry regret over them serving time."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "staying quiet now just hands them freedom and hands me the extra time",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "Would I regret them getting locked up too? No."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five or three. I pick three.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "As for them losing those years, I wouldn't regret that part."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Keeping silent to spare someone who's already turned on me would just be punishing myself.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I don't expect any remorse about that. None at all."
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Equal sentences seem less wrong than lopsided ones.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "I wouldn't regret the harm to them."
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "my silence would only spare them from facing what I face.",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "Would I wake up years later sorry about their sentence? Honestly, no."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Years are all I've got to bargain with",
    "pda_explicit_no_harm_regret": "them doing time too, I won't regret that"
  }
]
